      "message": "\u003e I agree that the protected range is currently hardcoded in the CrOS flash driver. However, the protection logic is implemented in the library rather than the driver. \n\nWhat do you mean it is hardcoded in `CrOS flash driver`. Via configs? Can the cros_flash driver set different protection ranges using the same library and rom code?",
